description=Smooth multiplayer vehicles. Remote cars are drawn ~60-100 ms behind instead of 500+ ms, follow a curve built from the driver's speed instead of straight segments, and never pop: prediction misses are blended out. The driver sends its car state ~30 times a second instead of ~6. Client-side Java (ZombieBuddy); every player needs it. If the game build does not match, it switches itself off and vanilla sync is used.
